  description: 
  title: Recursive Calls and Advanced Stack Handling
  content: 'Lesson 7: Recursive Calls and Advanced Stack Handling

    Objective:
    Learn how to manage recursive subroutines.

    Instructions Covered:

    Recursive
    Subroutines: Use CALL within a subroutine to call itself until a base case is
    met.

    Exercise Application: Exercise 10 (Recursive Rook) involves setting
    up a recursive call where the subroutine calls itself until AX reaches zero.

    

'
